## Torus with gap - hex sweep mesh (quad surface) for BEM inductance
## Run: playback "inductance_torus_quad.jou"
## Result: 736 surface quads, ~2208 BEM DOFs

reset

## Parameters
#{R = 0.05}
#{a = 0.005}
#{angle = 355}

## Create gapped torus by revolving circle
create surface circle radius {a} yplane
move surface 1 x {R} include_merged
sweep surface 1 zaxis angle {angle}

## Hex sweep mesh (coarse)
volume 1 scheme sweep source surface 1 target surface 3
surface 1 size {a}
surface 1 scheme pave
mesh surface 1
mesh volume 1

## Blocks: source/sink BEFORE boundary (subset before superset)
set duplicate block elements on
block 1 add volume all
block 1 name "conductor"
block 2 add face in surface 1
block 2 name "source"
block 3 add face in surface 3
block 3 name "sink"
block 4 add face in surface all
block 4 name "boundary"
